<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1805078926"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1891028315"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Solitude Rain"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="前田佳織里"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Butterfly / Solitude Rain / VIVID WORLD【桜坂しずく盤】"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:06.733"><div begin="00:07.101" end="03:43.170"><p begin="00:07.101" end="00:08.927" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">雷鳴が胸に鳴り響いて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">雷声在我的心间轰鸣</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ra i me i ga mu ne ni na ri hi bi i te</span></p><p begin="00:09.805" end="00:11.114" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">閉じ込めていた感情が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">长久埋藏于心的感情</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to ji ko me te i ta ka n jo u ga</span></p><p begin="00:11.333" end="00:12.158" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">溢れだしていく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">渐渐地汹涌洋溢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a fu re da shi te i ku</span></p><p begin="00:13.445" end="00:15.287" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">もう見失ったりしない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我再也不会遗失</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u mi u shi na 't ta ri shi na i</span></p><p begin="00:16.212" end="00:17.520" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">私だけの思いを<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只属于我的情感</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi da ke no o mo i wo</span></p><p begin="00:18.110" end="00:23.345" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">天から舞い落ちる雨粒が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从天而降的雨珠</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so ra ka ra ma i o chi ru a ma tsu bu ga</span></p><p begin="00:23.812" end="00:29.372" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">ぽつり ぽつり 頬伝って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一滴 一滴 沿着脸庞滑落</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">po tsu ri po tsu ri ho ho tsu ta 't te</span></p><p begin="00:30.131" end="00:32.564" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">知らないうちに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">浑然无觉间</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi ra na i u chi ni</span></p><p begin="00:32.904" end="00:35.995" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">心 覆っていた仮面を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一直覆于我心中的面具</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko ro o o 't te i ta ka me n wo</span></p><p begin="00:36.434" end="00:42.027" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">そっと洗い流していくの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也随着倾泻的雨而脱落</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so 't to a ra i na ga shi te i ku no</span></p><p begin="00:42.803" end="00:48.013" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">胸の奥 変わらない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">内心深处 从未改变</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mu ne no o ku ka wa ra na i</span></p><p begin="00:48.805" end="00:51.506" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">たったひとつの思いに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">始终如一的想法</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta 't ta hi to tsu no o mo i ni</span></p><p begin="00:51.523" end="00:54.957" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">やっと気づいたの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今我终于醒悟</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya 't to ki zu i ta no</span></p><p begin="00:55.462" end="00:58.291" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">目覚めてく 強く<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">坚定地睁开双眼</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">me za me te ku tsu yo ku</span></p><p begin="00:58.591" end="01:01.548" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">裸足で駆け出していこう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就这样光着脚向着前方奔去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha da shi de ka ke da shi te i ko u</span></p><p begin="01:01.765" end="01:07.204" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">どんな私からも逃げたりしない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">勇敢地去正视自己的每一面</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do n na wa ta shi ka ra mo ni ge ta ri shi na i</span></p><p begin="01:07.645" end="01:10.475" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">迷いも不安も全部<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论迷惘还是不安</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma yo i mo fu a n mo ze n bu</span></p><p begin="01:10.831" end="01:13.957" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">ありのまま抱きしめたなら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">全部都坦然地包容</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ri no ma ma da ki shi me ta na ra</span></p><p begin="01:14.226" end="01:20.696" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">まぶしいあの空へと 飛び出すよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">向着那片耀眼的天空 展翅飞翔</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma bu shi i a no so ra he to to bi da su yo</span></p><p begin="01:32.891" end="01:37.803" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">本当の私と向き合うこと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一直以来我都很害怕</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho n to u no wa ta shi to mu ki a u ko to</span></p><p begin="01:38.237" end="01:43.550" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">ずっとずっと怖かったけど<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">害怕面对真正的自己</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">zu 't to zu 't to ko wa ka 't ta ke do</span></p><p begin="01:44.609" end="01:49.597" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">私じゃない完璧な誰かには<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">已经不必再执意追求</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi ja na i ka n pe ki na da re ka ni wa</span></p><p begin="01:49.800" end="01:53.016" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">もうなれなくたっていい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那并不属于我的完美</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u na re na ku ta 't te i i</span></p><p begin="01:53.065" end="01:56.241" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">偽るのはおしまい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">已经不必再伪装自己</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu wa ru no wa o shi ma i</span></p><p begin="01:57.293" end="02:02.549" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">絶え間なく 溢れてる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">源源不断 涌上心间</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta e ma na ku a fu re te ru</span></p><p begin="02:03.620" end="02:06.033" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">私だけの思いを<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我还想编织更多</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi da ke no o mo i wo</span></p><p begin="02:06.033" end="02:09.400" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">もっと紡ぎたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只属于自己的感情</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo 't to tsu mu gi ta i</span></p><p begin="02:09.759" end="02:12.686" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">煌めいて 強く<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">绽放耀眼的光芒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki ra me i te tsu yo ku</span></p><p begin="02:12.996" end="02:15.709" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">この目を見つめて欲しい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望你注视我的双眼</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no me wo mi tsu me te ho shi i</span></p><p begin="02:16.212" end="02:22.013" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">どんな心からも逃げたりしない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">坦然地去面对自己的内心</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do n na ko ko ro ka ra mo ni ge ta ri shi na i</span></p><p begin="02:22.096" end="02:24.908" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">恐れも弱さも全部<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论恐惧还是弱小</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o so re mo yo wa sa mo ze n bu</span></p><p begin="02:25.061" end="02:28.386" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">こぼれ出す声にのせたら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">全都大声呼喊出来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko bo re da su ko e ni no se ta ra</span></p><p begin="02:28.706" end="02:35.184" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">まぶしいあの空へと 奏でるよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">向着那片耀眼的天空 奏响开来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma bu shi i a no so ra he to ka na de ru yo</span></p><p begin="02:47.594" end="02:49.667" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">世界でひとりきりの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">成为这个世界上</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se ka i de hi to ri ki ri no</span></p><p begin="02:49.667" end="02:52.250" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">私になる覚悟なら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">独一无二的自己</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi ni na ru ka ku go na ra</span></p><p begin="02:52.780" end="02:54.514" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">できているから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今我早已有这份觉悟</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">de ki te i ru ka ra</span></p><p begin="02:54.803" end="02:58.421" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">その瞳に映して<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让你的眼中倒映出我的身影</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no hi to mi ni u tsu shi te</span></p><p begin="02:58.858" end="03:05.201" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">私の色で 私だけのリアルで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">以我的色彩 以我独有的真实</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi no i ro de wa ta shi da ke no ri a ru de</span></p><p begin="03:05.462" end="03:11.750" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">あなたの心に触れたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想要触及你的心</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta no ko ko ro ni fu re ta i</span></p><p begin="03:12.115" end="03:15.107" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">目覚めてく 強く<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">坚定地睁开双眼</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">me za me te ku tsu yo ku</span></p><p begin="03:15.340" end="03:18.307" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">裸足で駆け出していこう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就这样光着脚向着前方奔去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha da shi de ka ke da shi te i ko u</span></p><p begin="03:18.612" end="03:24.193" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">どんな私からも逃げたりしない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">勇敢地去正视自己的每一面</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do n na wa ta shi ka ra mo ni ge ta ri shi na i</span></p><p begin="03:24.473" end="03:27.274" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">迷いも不安も全部<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论迷惘还是不安</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma yo i mo fu a n mo ze n bu</span></p><p begin="03:27.479" end="03:30.672" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">ありのまま抱きしめたなら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">全部都坦然地包容</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ri no ma ma da ki shi me ta na ra</span></p><p begin="03:30.932" end="03:34.124" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">まぶしいあの空へと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">向着那片耀眼的天空</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma bu shi i a no so ra he to</span></p><p begin="03:34.551" end="03:36.860" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">Ah 飛び出すよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">展翅飞翔</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Ah to bi da su yo</span></p><p begin="03:37.045" end="03:40.182" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">じきに雨が上がる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">雨很快就要停了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ji ki ni a me ga a ga ru</span></p><p begin="03:40.402" end="03:43.170" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">“Hello, This is me”</p></div></body></tt>